CM_ "Starter DBC generated from l77rodeo/gmlan README. Message presence/names are useful for SavvyCAN filtering. Except for the observed 1F5 PRNDL byte, signal bit positions/scaling are intentionally NOT invented. Verify DLC, senders, bit layout, scaling, counters, and checksums against your own E38/T43 capture.";
